      ],
      "title": "DNS: IXFR/AXFR queries with multiple responses",
      "message": "DNS: IXFR/AXFR queries with multiple responses\n\nIXFR and AXFR queries can have multiple DNS responses. As all responses\nbelong to one transaction, they have the same transaction ID.\n\nWe shouldn't handle them as retransmits.\n\nFix: wireshark/wireshark#17293\n(cherry picked from commit 07fb47111ee968ba132ce98764486dc825209e80)\n",
      "author_name": "Uli Heilmeier",
      "author_email": "uh@heilmeier.eu",
      "authored_date": "2021-03-21T10:15:56.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-03-23T11:49:13.000+00:00",
